    fix(nfapi): make VNF timing_window/mode/period configurable via nfapi_vnf_config_t
    
    Previously, nfapi_vnf_allocate_phy() hardcoded timing parameters (window=30,
    mode=0x03, period=10) ignoring any user configuration. Add the three fields
    to nfapi_vnf_config_t and initialize them with sensible defaults in
    nfapi_vnf_config_create() so callers can override before calling allocate_phy.
    nfapi_vnf_allocate_phy() now copies from config instead of using literals.
    
    Changes:
    - nfapi_vnf_interface.h: add timing_window, timing_info_mode,
      timing_info_period to nfapi_vnf_config_t
    - vnf_interface.c: initialize defaults in nfapi_vnf_config_create();
      use config fields in nfapi_vnf_allocate_phy()

